<wpt lat="44.656218" lon="-121.850899"><ele>1197.3</ele><name>Pamelia Lake, west shore</name><desc>source: OSM node 6062953973 on Pamelia Lake Trail 3439, where the trail reaches the lake's west end (69 m from the shore of OSM way 148399109; the trail then runs on along the north shore to the PCT); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 235; book_elev_ft: 3884; quote: From Highway 22 it is 5.9 miles to the lake, of which the forest trail is 2.3 miles</desc></wpt>
